  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3010.04 Length of Violation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3010.04 Length of Violation. For purposes of this regulation, the maximum number of days of violation associated with improper ERC use or insufficient ERC quantity shall be the number of consecutive days with insufficient ERC quantity after taking into account ERCs used to offset excess emissions on a consecutive day basis.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
